h a reset link by email; no social or single sign-on.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q2\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"54-loading-states\",\n   \"52-error-handling\",\n   \"71-testing-requirements\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-2\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"How should the system stop the same order being submitted twice? → assumed: Disable the submit button while the request is in progress, and reject a second submit of a basket that has already been turned into an order\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"sign-in\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q3\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"56-main-staff-screens\",\n   \"55-main-customer-screens\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-3\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Is 'Staff sign in' a separate login from customer sign-in? → assumed: Email and password, with a reset link by email; no social or single sign-on.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q6\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"64-pdf-generation\",\n   \"63-file-storage\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-4\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Is the invoice PDF generated once and stored, or generated on every download? → assumed: Generated when the invoice is created, stored, and the same file served on every download (regenerated only if missing)\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"reporting\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q7\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"39-reporting\",\n   \"71-testing-requirements\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-5\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"What counts as 'order value' and 'revenue' in the reports? → assumed: On-screen lists with filters and CSV export; no custom report builder.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"reporting\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q8\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"39-reporting\",\n   \"40-report-filters\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-6\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Which date decides whether an order falls inside the report's date range? → assumed: On-screen lists with filters and CSV export; no custom report builder.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"reporting\",\n